texto:
Translate this raw physical simulation metadata into a single, highly realistic, and conversational English request for the Earth-observation mission operator:

{
  "primary_sensor": "TIR",
  "location_details": {
    "country": "Colombia",
    "city": "Cubarral"
  },
  "priority_level": 3,
  "target_day": "the day after tomorrow",
  "target_diurnal_period": "in the morning"
}

Here is the final natural user request:

"Capture a high-resolution thermal map of Cubarral, Colombia, by the morning of the day after tomorrow. This is an absolute institutional priority, as it involves a critical payload capture and mandatory directive for our baseline pipeline tracking setup with fixed parameters representing normal operational status. We need to ensure the products are ingested into the pipeline before the morning of the day after tomorrow."
